<title>USA: Union Planters Corp Q3 shr down with charge.</title>
<headline>Union Planters Corp Q3 shr down with charge.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.69		    $0.79</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.67		     0.75</p>
<p> Net			 34,007		   38,014</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.35		    $2.31</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 2.25		     2.20</p>
<p> Net			113,794		  110,122</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q3 shr diluted includes one-time charge of $6.7 million, or about $0.13 per fully diluted common share, to replenish the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Total assets at September 30, 1996, were $11.5 billion versus $11.02 billion at September 30, 1995.</p>
<p>Total deposits at September 30, 1996, were $9.2 billion versus $9.3 billion at September 30, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
